        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Services",
        "text_hash": "548f9d2e40acf70d4b8c59fb7a2be6427c4cb97cc2e359fb74b25f5166e1556b",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000565-10ac7317",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[609]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 565,
        "reported_page": 36,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_136",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Services operating income increased $18.1 billion from 2024 to 2025. The increase in operating income was primarily driven by an increase in revenues, partially offset by an increase in expenses related to legal and other matters, TAC, and content acquisition costs.",
        "text_hash": "10ac73172f88852505ff3135a45aff9fe826753a3ec4273b66e4ee38bc3a439a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000566-69bd2211",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[610]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 566,
        "reported_page": 36,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_136",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Cloud",
        "text_hash": "69bd2211a05e151338291eb88add1fcdd30966b4d92a1de7f3fb651f3e5078db",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000567-3105e406",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[611]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 567,
        "reported_page": 36,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_136",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Cloud operating income increased $7.8 billion from 2024 to 2025. The increase in operating income was primarily driven by an increase in revenues, partially offset by increases in usage costs for technical infrastructure and employee compensation expenses.",
        "text_hash": "3105e40666321e9f45dd8d0202ad2fe05d82689a0c61b8c7f75fcb11e2e4f459",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
